  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan finds reputation restriction Immortal Gu, a rare information path rank seven Immortal Gu, in Wu clan’s inner treasury, which he asks to see when Wu Yong offers to let him exchange vajra thought Immortal Gu for a rank six Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1305
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "fac_wu_clan",
          "char_wu_yong",
          "gu_vajra_thought_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He is very interested in it because his information path is weak and greatly restricts his development. Once used, it turns into a rope that restricts any desolate beast or desolate plant, even ancient desolate ones, so although it is an information path Gu it has an enslavement path effect. Its effect varies according to its owner’s reputation. Fang Yuan judges that it cannot enslave an immemorial desolate beast by itself, and that the only possibility is to use it as the core of an immortal killer move. He makes no exchange and keeps vajra thought Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1306
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan tells Wu Yong that he could use reputation restriction Immortal Gu to reinforce the super Gu formation and gain more benefits for Wu clan. Wu Yong hesitates, not from suspicion but over how reliable the plan is. He has never suspected that Wu Yi Hai, the identity Fang Yuan is using, is an impostor.",
        "chapters": [
          1369
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "super-gu-formation-plan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_super_gu_formation",
          "char_wu_yi_hai"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wu Yong’s hesitation is brief, and he lends reputation restriction Immortal Gu to Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan plans to use it to control the upper extreme heavenly eagle, an immemorial desolate beast with rank eight battle strength, though he has little confidence because the Gu is only rank seven. The one thing that gives him hope is his strong reputation, which he hopes will let the Gu display incredible power.",
        "chapters": [
          1370
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-from-wu-clan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu is not his and he has only borrowed it from Wu clan, and he thinks it would probably not have enough strength to control the rank eight upper extreme heavenly eagle. He controls the eagle instead with Purple Mountain True Monarch’s method, the immortal killer move hundred and eighty slaves.",
        "chapters": [
          1374
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-from-wu-clan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan lists Reputation Restriction among his rank seven Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1461
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-from-wu-clan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
